\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. SPREAD the table of the Lord,
\par Break the bread and pour the wine;
\par Gathered at the sacred board,
\par We would taste the feast divine.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Saints and martyrs of the faith
\par To the Cross have turned their eyes,
\par Sharing, in their life and death,
\par That eternal sacrifice.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Humbly now our place we claim
\par In that glorious company,
\par Proud confessors of the name,
\par Breaking bread, O Christ, with Thee.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. By the memory of Thy love,
\par To the glory of the Lord,
\par Here we raise Thy Cross above,
\par Gird us with Thy Spirit's sword.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. Guided by Thy mighty hand,
\par All Thy mind we would fulfil,
\par Loyal to Thy least command,
\par Serving Thee with steadfast will.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

